<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vesta Insurance raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vesta Insurance raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it raised its rating on Vesta Insurance Group Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At current levels we believe the common has the potential to offer investors attractive upside, with the downside protection of the company's recently announced two million share buyback program,&quot; analyst Brad Eichler said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 at 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
